@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3088

### Database connectivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Current and upcoming events (past and suspended excluded)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events

### Category dropdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Combined filters; use a starts_at date from the current dataset
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?location=Southport&category=1

### Specific event
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/1

### Free event
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/2

### Past detail remains readable
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/11

### Suspended event: expected 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/12

### Invalid calendar date: expected 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?date=2026-02-30

### No matches: expected 200, data: []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?location=NoSuchSuburb

### A literal percent sign does not match all locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?location=%25

### Writes are unavailable: expected 405
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
